  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper presents three IBM QPU experiments for weighted-sum/inner-product estimation: a 7-qubit expected-value computation on ibmq_casablanca with measured amplitude ≈0.17747 vs simulator ≈0.17835, a 3-qubit trigonometric-distribution linear-function experiment on ibmq_jakarta with ≈0.72996 vs ≈0.77998, and a 3-qubit normal-distribution linear-function experiment on ibmq_jakarta with ≈0.57378 vs ≈0.60131. All are small-scale NISQ demonstrations with no classical runtime advantage shown.",
